      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LinkedIn ads of a competitor to Google Sheets every tuesday\n\nEvery Tuesday, fetch the ads an advertiser runs on LinkedIn, with text, format, dates and targeting, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get LinkedIn ads** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get LinkedIn ads** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $1 per 1,000 ads. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/linkedin-ad-library-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
